<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>org.clickpart.Clickpart</id>
  <name>Clickpart</name>
  <summary>Universal graphical installer for Linux</summary>
  <description>
    <p>Clickpart is a lightweight graphical installer for Linux. Double-click on package files
    to install them without using the terminal.</p>
    <p>Supported formats:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Arch Linux packages (<code>.pkg.tar.zst</code>, <code>.pkg.tar.xz</code>)</li>
      <li>Flatpak applications (<code>.flatpakref</code>, <code>.flatpak</code>)</li>
      <li>AppImage applications (<code>.AppImage</code>)</li>
      <li>Snap packages (<code>.snap</code>)</li>
      <li>VS Code extensions (<code>.vsix</code>)</li>
      <li>GNOME Shell extensions (<code>.shell-extension.zip</code>)</li>
      <li>Java applications (<code>.jar</code>)</li>
      <li>Installer scripts (<code>.run</code>, <code>.sh</code>)</li>
      <li>Windows applications via Wine (<code>.exe</code>, <code>.msi</code>)</li>
      <li>Arch build scripts (<code>PKGBUILD</code>)</li>
      <li>Archives with heuristic installation (<code>.tar.gz</code>, <code>.zip</code>, etc.)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>Clickpart shows you exactly what command will be run before executing it,
    and requires confirmation by default for safety.</p>
  </description>
